{"unit_id":"Bob-Bo1__obsidian-workbench#card-zh","repo":"Bob-Bo1/obsidian-workbench","commit":"b2ec41a0ad51ea9ea6fad85101619959b4b9c2f9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Obsidian Workbench for DSH 是面向 DSH Web 的 Obsidian 风格三栏工作台：左侧浏览本机 vault，中间用 CodeMirror 编辑 Markdown，右侧连接当前 DSH 会话。它从 Windows Obsidian 配置或 OBSIDIAN_VAULT_PATH 读取仓库，并通过 DSH Web 服务提供目录、笔记和附件访问。用户可以搜索笔记、自动保存编辑、新建和整理文件，也能把笔记内容加入对话。适合希望在 DSH 中查看和维护 Obsidian 笔记的用户。需要本机 Obsidian vault；不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:344-375","lib/index.js:387-475","lib/client-source.js:1710-1725"]}
